The handler can block the alias before either backend call, so this does not require a new backend argument. The backend’s existing miss result remains all-ones at register zero and zero elsewhere. I also found the guest tree and manual one directory above the checkout; no native GDB is on PATH, and WSL enumeration returned access denied.
